  "worked_solution": "Three (or more) points are collinear if a straight line passes through all points.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn.\n\n- Diagram I shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14214315/assets/611d93edb119e6bdc60bc3492b72d2c08730ef946232e3c3189b7d04eab43c18.png)\n\n- Diagram II shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14214315/assets/32bb229224aac8d0b8feda0160c00d7afa9aa42827f448834a173b926a9dd48b.png)\n\n \n\n- Diagram III shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14214315/assets/3886d294defeb0a4e43c5612c981b6b392a23067c0ecb51ebab6c2dab154c218.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-155030\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Three (or more) points are collinear if a straight line passes through all points.</p>\n<p>With that in mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram I shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points. </li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-155030-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-155030-e-0\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram II shows three points that are <em>not</em> collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-155030-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-155030-e-1\"></div> \n\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram III shows three points that are <em>not</em> collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-155030-e-2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-155030-e-2\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div>",
